OL,3,GNEWSAI'm one of a growing number of Gen
OL,4,AZ birdwatchers - it helps my mental
OL,5,Ahealth
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I would be such a grump," says Caitlin
OL,8,FAndrew, recalling her teenage self on
OL,9,Fwalks with her parents.
OL,11,F"They are both into birdwatching and
OL,12,Fthey would stop and listen and look at
OL,13,Fthings.
OL,15,F"We had some really nice walks and
OL,16,Fexperiences, but I just didn't have an
OL,17,Finterest in them at the time. I do feel
OL,18,Fquite bad about it now."
